cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use blind-adapters or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "blind-adapters: reasoning adapters fetched by private information retrieval"
abstract: >-
  Research proof of concept. A laptop runs Qwen3-8B and fetches a task LoRA adapter
  from an untrusted cloud by private information retrieval. Pre-registered adapter
  verdict on 12 held-out legal matters: PASS. The adapter matched precomputed text
  reasoning in scope and beat the base model on novel questions. 0 secrets reached the
  cloud. Routing verdict: FAIL, 10 of 12.
